&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop concise, executive-ready updates that connect frontline performance, member impact, risks, tradeoffs, and recommended next steps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
