&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience leading complex, cross-functional initiatives from problem definition through execution, change management, and measurement of impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong influence, relationship-building, and communication skills, including the ability to drive alignment and accountability without direct authority.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
