&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chime is looking for a Director of Engineering to lead our AI &amp;amp; App Experience (AAX) organization — the team building the next generation of the Chime member experience. AAX owns Jade, Chime’s AI-powered financial assistant, our AI platform infrastructure as well as the core app experiences and shared design system.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll own the multi-quarter strategy for AAX engineering, translating company priorities into scalable plans across these teams. You’ll build and lead a bench of TLM (tech leader managers) and senior technical staff, set the technical bar for how Chime builds AI-native, member-facing products, and partner with Product, Design, Data Science, and our Risk team to shape where AAX invests next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for a leader who is equally comfortable setting long-range technical vision and staying close enough to the details to guide hard architectural calls — someone who has helped build or scale AI/LLM-powered consumer products and knows how to grow the engineering leaders around them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary offered for this role and level of experience will begin at &lt;span class=&quot;collapsed-field-text&quot;&gt;$269,000.00&lt;/span&gt; and up to &lt;span class=&quot;collapsed-field-text&quot;&gt;$373,000.00&lt;/span&gt;. Full-time employees are also eligible for a bonus, competitive equity package, and benefits. The actual base salary offered may be higher, depending on your location, skills, qualifications, and experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you can expect to&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In partnership with our product team you will own the multi-quarter strategy for AAX engineering, translating company and product priorities into our roadmap plans across consumer facing AI experiences, AI Platform, App Journey, and Design Systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead, and hire a high-caliber leadership bench of highly technical leaders/IC’s as well as building a team culture that exemplifies a builder mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with your team to set technical direction for the org, driving architectural alignment across our consumer facing AI experiences, AI Platform, App Journey, and Design System.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will continue to drive our AI-native engineering culture: setting the bar for how LLM-powered features get shipped safely at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own engineering’s strategic role in product direction, partnering with Product, Design, Data Science, and Risk leadership to shape roadmaps, challenge assumptions, and integrate platform and member value into long-range plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent AAX and engineering more broadly in cross-functional and executive forums, connecting the org’s work to company-wide strategy and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate a&amp;nbsp; high-performing culture across the org, modeling Chime’s values and ensuring strong talent, performance, and career development practices on every team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the org maintains strong operational practices — on-call, monitoring, and incident response — for every service/experience the team owns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to overall engineering initiatives as a member of Chime’s engineering leadership team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To thrive in this role, you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience, including 5+ years managing managers or leading multi-team engineering organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building and scaling AI/LLM-powered consumer products, with the technical depth to guide future investments and technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience hiring, developing, and retaining engineering leaders (TLM’s and Staff+ ICs), and building leadership pipelines and succession plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fundamentals across relevant parts of the stack (e.g., React Native, Python or Ruby on Rails, GraphQL, distributed systems) and the judgment to know where to go deep&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate company and product strategy into multi-quarter engineering plans, and to adapt org design as priorities and scale evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent executive communication skills — you can craft a compelling narrative that connects org strategy to business outcomes for senior leaders and cross-functional partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering closely with Product, Design, Data Science, and Risk/Compliance functions in a regulated or high-trust environment (fintech experience a strong plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native fluency and a genuine interest in AI-native ways of working, with a track record of fostering that practice across teams rather than treating it as someone else’s job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The desire to make a huge difference at a growing company, and the ability to motivate teams through delivery on aggressive schedules and goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
