&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We&#39;re hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the design of some of Chime&#39;s most important member experiences across &lt;strong&gt;Growth, Spending, or Lending&lt;/strong&gt;. This is a highly influential individual contributor role for a designer who combines exceptional visual craft with systems thinking and product strategy. You&#39;ll help define not just how our products look and feel, but what we build and why—creating experiences that millions of members rely on to make financial progress.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll partner closely with Product, Engineering, Research, Data, and Content Design to solve complex customer problems, shape product direction, and deliver elegant, intuitive experiences from concept through launch. If you&#39;re energized by ambiguity, obsessed with craft, and excited to raise the quality bar across an organization, we&#39;d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The base salary offered for this role and level of experience will begin at $174,000 and up to $245,000. Full-time employees are also eligible for a bonus, competitive equity package, and benefits. The actual base salary offered may be higher, depending on your location, skills, qualifications, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
