&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Full-Stack Engineer to join our team and help build Jade, Chime&#39;s AI-powered financial assistant.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a senior engineer on this team, you&#39;ll work across the full breadth of what it takes to bring an AI product to life — from designing new agent capabilities and conversation experiences to building the eval frameworks, observability, and guardrail systems that ensure Jade is reliable and safe for millions of members. You&#39;ll shape how Jade reasons, acts, and improves over time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll build member-facing capabilities that help people manage their spending, stay on top of subscriptions, and hit their financial goals. You&#39;ll also develop internal tools, dashboards, and backend services for model routing, prompt management, agent orchestration, and evaluation pipelines. The AI landscape evolves rapidly, and so does Jade. You&#39;ll need to learn quickly, adapt to shifting priorities, and proactively identify what&#39;s needed next — whether that&#39;s a new financial capability, a better way to test conversations, or a system to keep quality high as we scale. If you&#39;re excited about the unique challenges of shipping LLM-powered products at scale, this is the role for you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The base salary offered for this role and level of experience will begin at $164,000 and up to $227,000. Full-time employees are also eligible for a bonus, competitive equity package, and benefits. The actual base salary offered may be higher, depending on your location, skills, qualifications, and experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you can expect to&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
