&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop agent architectures, prompt strategies, and orchestration patterns that shape how Jade reasons and acts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
